# The folder of MinerBot's dashboard's socket. From deploy/minerbot-dashboard.tmpfiles in the MinerBot repository;
# deploy.sh installs it as /etc/tmpfiles.d/minerbot-dashboard.conf, so change it there. /run is emptied at every boot, and
# systemd-tmpfiles makes the folder again before Docker starts: mode 2750, owned by 1654, the dashboard's user, and the
# group nobody, nginx's workers. Only the dashboard can make its socket there, and only processes in the group nobody,
# nginx's workers and cPanel's Apache among them, can reach it. The setgid bit gives the socket the group nobody.
d /run/minerbot-dashboard 2750 1654 nobody -
